  - "B\xEAn em \u0111ang c\xF3 ch\u01B0\u01A1ng tr\xECnh tr\u1EA3 g\xF3p."
  - "M\u1EABu n\xE0y pin t\u1ED1t, d\xF9ng h\u1EB1ng ng\xE0y \u1ED5n l\u1EAFm."
  - "Anh ch\u1ECB c\u1EA7n em t\u01B0 v\u1EA5n theo t\u1EA7m gi\xE1 kh\xF4ng?"
  interactionDistance: 1.55
  interactionCenter: {x: 0, y: 1.1, z: 0}
  animator: {fileID: 340804375}
